From: zhangzujian <zhangzujian.7@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 15:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Harden control request I/O

Bound control client I/O with a monotonic deadline, prevent idle clients from
occupying a serial command thread for ten seconds, receive fragmented commands,
and send complete replies without blocking or raising SIGPIPE.

Also reject operations when scheduler signaling fails, initialize every queued
operation field, and emit rate-limited stage timings for slow or failed control
requests, including clients that never finish a command.

Signed-off-by: zhangzujian <zhangzujian.7@gmail.com>
---
